              <calculation class='tableau' formula='if (([Subsidy per Voucher (copy)_5158591907037593600]) - [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366]) / [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366] &gt;= 0.2 then -2&#10;elseif (([Subsidy per Voucher (copy)_5158591907037593600]) - [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366]) / [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366] &lt;= -0.2 then 2&#10;elseif (([Subsidy per Voucher (copy)_5158591907037593600]) - [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366]) / [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366] &lt;= -0.1 then 1&#10;elseif (([Subsidy per Voucher (copy)_5158591907037593600]) - [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366]) / [L7 Avg Subsidy Per Order AVG (copy)_5158591907040911366] &gt;= 0.1 then -1&#10;else 0&#10;end'>
